    <name>Thames Reach Fixture</name>
    <description>
      A KML track for #191 KV-2. Latitude (~51.5) and longitude (~-1.2) differ
      by more than 10 degrees, so a transposition cannot pass unnoticed, and
      the track is long enough to row start to finish in the 3D scene.
    </description>
